# CVs and résumés — these carry home addresses, personal phone numbers and
# private email. Source material only; never publish. Processed headshots that
# belong on the site live in public/brand/team/ instead.
#
# The leading slash anchors this to the repository root. Without it, and because
# Windows sets core.ignorecase=true, the pattern also swallowed
# public/brand/team/ and silently kept every headshot out of the repo.
/Team/
*.pdf
*.docx

